5 Hacking
*********

It is possible to define new runbox dispatcher commands, although a
stable API for it is not yet defined.  Refer to the source code, as it
is thoroughly documented.

   The core dispatching logic comes from the ‘runbox-funcall’, a
granular dispatching is done with the ‘runbox-with-routing’ macro.

   A Runbox command shall call ‘runbox-assert’ in the directory it will
work on, in both its body function and interactive form, to ensure
correct state.


